# INVWINPV.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:PREV.CFG, a settings file that is not there: the preview beside
# the item list.  The item list opens with the preview of item 1 beside
# it, its fields, its location and its notes; DOWN, and it shows item 2,
# which has no notes, at its place three locations deep.  F6 gives the
# preview the focus, the Record menu gaining Back; ENTER there opens
# item 2's form in view mode, whose ESC comes back to the preview; TAB
# gives the focus back to the list, SHIFT-F6 to the preview and ESC to
# the list; a click on the preview gives it the focus too, SHIFT-F10
# there opens the Record menu as a pop-up, whose O opens item 2's form,
# and from the list a right click on the preview gives it the focus and
# opens the pop-up again; ESC, after the pop-up's, gives the focus back.
# With the focus in the preview the frame is maximized and restored:
# each new size, where other rows fit the list, makes the preview anew,
# item 2 in it and the focus kept.  View > Pane beside the list,
# checked, hides the preview, item 2 still selected, and F6 does
# nothing; chosen again it shows the preview of item 2.  The end by
# Exit, the choice kept: TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/PREV.CFG is the settings file
# it leaves.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPV.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/framchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEM1
K DOWN
S ITEM2
K F6
S PANE
K ENTER
S FORM
K ESC
S CLOSED
K TAB
S TABBACK
K SHIFT-F6
S PANE2
K ESC
S ESCBACK
M 222 DOWN MID
M 222 UP MID
S CLICK
K SHIFT-F10
S KEYPOP
K O
S POPOPEN
K ESC ESC
M 222 RDOWN MID
M 222 RUP MID
S MOUSEPOP
K ESC
S POPCLOSE
K ALT-SPACE X
S MAX
K ALT-SPACE R
S RESTORED
K ESC
S CLICKESC
K ALT-V
S VIEWMENU
K P
S ALONE
K F6
S NOPANE
K ALT-V P
S AGAIN
K ALT-F X
